SOAPBOX: K4D and SPE Expert 2K-FA
SOAPBOX: At one point, 15 was open to all 6 continents!  Sadly, the big openings to Asia
SOAPBOX: that we had during the week did not occur so limited JA and YB with no BY at
SOAPBOX: all.
SOAPBOX: In the past, I’ve done 20-meter single band but with the incredible conditions on 15 this past week I thought 15 would be the place to be.  During the week, in the evenings, I was running a never-ending string of JA, YB, BY and other Asians.  In the contest, conditions shifted so this great string was limited with no BY or other Asians – only a limited number of JA and an even more limited number of YB.  I did work YB’s during the day.
SOAPBOX: At one point in the early evening, all 6 continents were coming in, that was incredible.
